PAL12L6
SM2_DOP6
DoppleBoard snes Adress Decoder(2 megabyte version)
modified back to 1 megabyte to allow DSP addressing

PIN1 A15 A16 A17 A18 A19 A20 CE WE GND
OE A21 ROM RAM WORMRD WORMWR TCRSEL PIN18 A22 VCC

; RAM BANK 0	0XXXXX
; RAM BANK 1	1XXXXX
; ROM		20XXXX
; CRAM		21XXXX
; WORM		22XXXX

/ROM =	/A22 * A21 * /A20 * /A19 * /A18 * /A17 * /A16 * /CE

/TCRSEL = /A22 * A21 * /A20 * /A19 * /A18 * /A17 * A16 * /CE

/RAM =	/A21 * /A20 * /CE +
        /A22 *  A21 * /A20 * /A19 * /A18 * /A17 * A16 * /CE

/WORMWR =
	/A22 * A21 * /A20 * /A19 * /A18 * A17 * /A16 * /CE * /WE

/WORMRD =
	/A22 * A21 * /A20 * /A19 * /A18 * A17 * /A16 * /CE * /OE



